{
  "rig_target": 1,
  "description": "dimabot bot (dima-bot): the frozen TypeScript bot at 0c71108e in image dimabot-ref:0c71108e, production command and variable names with test values only, every outbound request sent to the side's mock by the Node preload. The EventSub ingress listens on 3333 inside, remapped to the rig's port `eventsub`. The API is not running: calls to dima-server:3000 (INTERNAL_API_URL) and api.domdimabot.com are answered by scenario routes. Candidate: not ported yet.",
  "ports": [
    "eventsub"
  ],
